{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10304","headline":"赠沛禅师 · 皇甫曾","name":"赠沛禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南岳满湘沅，吾师经利涉。\n身归沃洲老，名与支公接。\n净教传荆吴，道缘止渔猎。\n观空色不染，对境心自惬。\n室中人寂寞，门外山重叠。\n天台积幽梦，早晚当负笈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}